r['studyAbroadPrepared']=write('diy','birmingham-city-campus-course-budget-planning','英國選校先找對校區：Birmingham City的城市學習與通勤功課','Start with the right campus: planning study and travel at Birmingham City','從兩個主要校區看課程與住宿距離，再核對台灣入學路徑及一月申請時程。','Compare the two main campuses, course locations and housing travel before checking Taiwan entry routes and January deadlines.',[
('先從一張地圖開始','Begin with a map','想到英國讀書，選校資料常先比排名和學費，但每天要去哪棟樓上課，也會影響生活安排。Birmingham City University官方地圖列出City Centre與City South兩個主要校區，還有分布於城市的其他據點。今天的選校練習，是把「伯明罕」這個城市名稱再縮小到真正的課程地址；不要把城市裡不同大學當成同一所，也不要以為同校所有課程都在同一處。','When choosing a UK university, rankings and fees often come first, but the daily teaching location also shapes life. BCU lists City Centre and City South as its two main campuses, with other sites across Birmingham. This exercise narrows a city name to the actual course address, distinguishing both different universities and different locations within one institution.'),
('兩個校區與課程生活','Campuses and everyday study','City Centre位於Eastside，官方列Curzon、Parkside、Millennium Point與STEAMhouse等建築；City South位於Edgbaston，包含健康專業、護理助產、生命科學及社會工作。British Global的校園指南也區分兩個地點。這是校區概況，不能代替個別課程表；有實驗、工作坊或校外活動的學程，還應確認一週可能需要往返哪些場所。','City Centre in Eastside includes Curzon, Parkside, Millennium Point and STEAMhouse. City South in Edgbaston houses health professions, nursing and midwifery, life sciences and social work. British Global independently distinguishes the locations. This overview does not replace a course timetable; laboratory, workshop and off-campus activities may add travel.'),
('台灣學歷與一月入學','Taiwan qualifications and January entry','官方台灣頁分別列學士與研究所的學歷、科系及英語要求。準備一月入學者還要讀國際申請時程：台灣居住地目前適用12月4日申請截止及12月11日CAS訂金期限。這些日期不能套到所有居住地或2027年9月。獎學金可能減輕學費，但不會取代學歷與語言條件；是否有名額仍以課程當時狀態為準。','BCU’s Taiwan page sets out undergraduate and postgraduate qualifications, subject and English requirements. For January entry, Taiwan domicile currently uses December 4 for applications and December 11 for the CAS deposit. These are not universal dates for every domicile or September 2027. Funding does not replace entry requirements, and availability remains course-specific.'),
('用可核對的日常安排比較','Compare verifiable everyday arrangements','本刊建議把課程地址、住宿地址、交通方式與合約週數放在同一張表，再比較必修內容和學校支持。先把確定支出算清楚，尚未取得的工作與獎學金不要當成已入帳收入。留學DIY導航今日加入BCU的基本資料與官方入口，方便與其他英國學校一起篩選；本文未訪問在校生，也不虛構校園生活故事或就業保證。','Our recommendation is to compare course and housing addresses, travel and contract length alongside required modules and support. Calculate confirmed expenses separately from unconfirmed jobs or awards. Today the DIY guide adds BCU’s basic details and official link for comparison with other UK institutions. This article adds no student interviews, invented experiences or employment promises.')],[('BCU — official campus map',maps),('British Global — independent campus guide',guide),('BCU — Taiwan admissions','https://www.bcu.ac.uk/international/bcu-in-your-country/taiwan'),('BCU — January deadlines','https://www.bcu.ac.uk/international/your-application/key-dates')],'study-abroad',dict(category=t('留學DIY導航','Study abroad DIY'),country=t('英國','United Kingdom'),topic='uk'))
